Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Two-dimensional diffusion FEM", "Title",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"59c61dc2-c1bc-734f-96fd-f0f89c6596aa"],

Cell["\:7f2a\:96e8\:8f69 / Miao Yuxuan \[CenterDot] \:6dee\:5357\:5e08\:8303\
\:5b66\:9662 / Huainan Normal University", "Subtitle",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"66a39732-5b1e-434b-9481-3fa9c1188ce0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model, inputs and scope", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"da1b054b-3681-d447-8efa-b21655ea831c"],

Cell["\[Del]\[UpTee]\.b2Ez\[Minus]j\[Omega]\[Mu]\[Sigma]Ez=0; Jz=\[Sigma]Ez", \
"Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"038fe404-d9ef-4940-9f0f-43bb76223cfb"],

Cell["SI; exp(+j omega t); RMS; sigma=58 MS/m; mu_r=1; 20 C", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"6eb30072-af5f-4041-ac47-e7866e7bcb83"],

Cell["\<\
Change mesh_h; run at least three meshes before making a convergence claim.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"aa844831-1f80-2e40-acc9-f1abc9088d92"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Derivation and interpretation", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"1cbcea68-1a16-814a-ac40-ff7163dae803"],

Cell["\<\
The circular cross section solves \[Del]\[UpTee]\.b2Ez\[Minus]j\[Omega]\[Mu]\
\[Sigma]Ez=0. A constant boundary field is normalized to the total complex \
current; the circle polygon, interpolation order and mesh size determine \
numerical error.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"db052d7a-090c-1740-8fd1-9e1b2e3731bb"],

Cell["\<\
The weak form integrates \
\[Del]v\[CenterDot]\[Del]Ez+j\[Omega]\[Mu]\[Sigma]vEz over the domain, \
subject to the stated boundary value. Integrate the resulting current and \
Joule density independently and compare Rac with the Bessel solution.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"29627e74-64d7-324f-8429-05e681e6cc7c"],

Cell["\<\
This tutorial uses one mesh. Repeat at three or more decreasing h/a values \
and inspect boundary/polygon resolution before claiming accuracy; integral \
conservation alone does not bound field error.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"59a40068-4727-fa4d-b7f2-a44c2021dba4"],

